Package: DspikeIn
Type: Package
Title: Quantifying Absolute Abundance to Enhance Microbial Dynamics Assessment
Version: 1.2.3
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Mitra", family = "Ghotbi", role = c("aut", "cre"), 
           email = "mitra.ghotbi@gmail.com")
Maintainer: Mitra Ghotbi <mitra.ghotbi@gmail.com>
Description: 
    The DspikeIn package facilitates the quantification of absolute microbial 
    abundance, improving the evaluation of microbial dynamics—a critical aspect 
    of microbial ecology research. It extends the functionality of the phyloseq 
    package and incorporates enhanced functions from several key packages, 
    including dplyr, stats, ggplot2, edgeR, ggtree, flextable, DESeq2, 
    microbiomeutilities, DECIPHER, and speedyseq. 
    It provides tools for data integration, visualization, and statistical 
    analysis, leveraging TreeSummarizedExperiment and other Bioconductor 
    infrastructure.
biocViews: Microbiome, Software, DataImport, StatisticalMethod, Visualization
